<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<chapter xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" xml:id="intro-highdim">
  <title>Introduction to High Dimensional Data</title>
  
  <introduction>
    <p>
      This chapter introduces high dimensional data. For the foundational material, see
      <xref ref="matrices-in-R"/>, <xref ref="linear-algebra"/>, <xref ref="dimension-reduction"/>,
      <xref ref="sec-latent-factor-models"/>, and <xref ref="sec-regularization"/>. For background on the
      linear algebra and matrix factorization used here, see <fn><url href="http://joshua.smcvt.edu/linearalgebra/">Hefferon's
      Linear Algebra</url></fn> and the BellKor
      <fn><url href="https://www.netflixprize.com/assets/GrandPrize2009_BPC_BellKor.pdf">Netflix Prize paper</url></fn>.
    </p>
  </introduction>

</chapter>
